## MEPS applied study.
##
## The 2023 MEPS Full-Year Consolidated file is a public AHRQ release and is
## freely redistributable, so nothing here is excluded for confidentiality
## reasons. Only three categories are excluded: the raw input file, which is
## roughly 60 MB and is instead fetched by download_meps_h251.R; posterior draw
## objects, which are large and fully regenerable; and the local manuscript
## build materials. Every derived results table, figure and note is committed,
## so the MEPS arm reproduces from a clean checkout.
/applied_study/Literature_Review
## Private correspondence, not research material.
/applied_study/Wangs_email.md
/applied_study/h251.csv
/applied_study/meps_2023_dental_hurdle_model_data.csv
/applied_study/*.rds
/applied_study/*.log
/applied_study/*.bib
/applied_study/*.tex
/applied_study/*.pdf
/applied_study/imsart.cls
/applied_study/imsart.sty
/applied_study/ba.bst


## Oncology applied study (SPECTRUM, Project Data Sphere).
##
## Every patient-level file and every per-patient derivative is excluded, and
## this exclusion is deliberate and required. Section III.B(ii) of the Project
## Data Sphere Platform Agreement prohibits disclosure of the data to any third
## party who is not a registered Authorized User, and Article VIII requires
## strict confidence. That is contractual confidentiality rather than patient
## privacy, so further de-identification does not make a per-patient file safe
## to post. Article VII permits disclosure of what is reasonably necessary to
## publish research results, which is why aggregate estimates and plots appear
## in the manuscript, but the agreement does not define where a derived
## quantity stops being "the Data". The results tables in this directory are
## therefore also withheld pending written confirmation from Project Data
## Sphere or Amgen; they are regenerable by any Authorized User from the
## scripts, which are committed.
/applied_study_oncology/Literature_Review
/applied_study_oncology/*.csv
/applied_study_oncology/*.md
/applied_study_oncology/*.txt
/applied_study_oncology/*.bib
/applied_study_oncology/*.tex
/applied_study_oncology/*.pdf
/applied_study_oncology/meps.Rmd
/applied_study_oncology/imsart.cls
/applied_study_oncology/*.rds
/applied_study_oncology/*.log
/applied_study_oncology/imsart.sty
/applied_study_oncology/ba.bst
/applied_study_oncology/gamma_hurdle_draws.rds
/applied_study_oncology/zicbcf_hurdle_run.log
/applied_study_oncology/zicbcf_hurdle_draws.rds
